[00:00.54]1. Lovingly Jehovah
[00:05.70]Made provision through his Son
[00:11.16]For our sins to be forgiven
[00:16.40]And for death to be undone.
[00:22.28]If we truly are repentant,
[00:27.46]His forgiveness we can claim
[00:33.38]On the basis of Christ’s ransom,
[00:38.50]Asking pardon in his name.
[00:48.62]2. We receive such mercy
[00:52.88]When we act like God above
[00:58.02]And forgive each other freely,
[01:04.08]Showing empathy and love.
[01:09.12]Putting up with one another,
[01:14.52]Putting hurtfulness away;
[01:20.24]Showing honor to our brother,
[01:25.76]Showing love’s surpassing way.
[01:36.14]3. Mercy is a virtue
[01:40.34]That we all should cultivate.
[01:46.24]It will keep us from resentment,
[01:51.66]From the bitterness of hate.
[01:57.80]When we imitate Jehovah,
[02:03.72]Who is unsurpassed in love,
[02:09.38]We will truly be forgiving;
[02:15.10]We will be like God above.
